          "description": "(Required except for the stated conditions in PDF 2.0; optional in PDF 1.2 through 1.7) An appearance dictionary. In PDF 2.0 it is required except for Rect[0]==Rect[2] AND Rect[1]==Rect[3], or Subtype Popup, Projection or Link. AP.N defines the normal appearance; state dictionaries require a name AS. An unmatched state retains the processor fallback defined in 12.5.5.",
